Version 4
SHEET 1 3400 2000
TEXT 100 40 Left 2 ;========================================================================================
TEXT 100 70 Left 2 ;COMPUTE-IN-MEMORY (CiM) 4-ROW NEURAL CROSSBAR WITH STREAMING PREDICTIVE DELTA-SIGMA READOUT
