* 2. SHARED COLUMN BITLINE (INTEGRATOR 1) & FEEDBACK DAC
TEXT 1350 200 Left 2 ;[2. COLUMN BITLINE (INTEGRATOR 1) & DAC]
SYMBOL cap 1380 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Cbl
SYMATTR Value 100f
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0.25
WIRE 1396 240 1396 286
FLAG 1396 240 vbl
WIRE 1396 334 1396 390
FLAG 1396 390 0

SYMBOL res 1500 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Rbl
SYMATTR Value 500k
WIRE 1516 240 1516 286
FLAG 1516 240 vbl
WIRE 1516 366 1516 390
FLAG 1516 390 0

SYMBOL bi 1660 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Bidac
SYMATTR Value I=50u*(1/(1+exp(-40*(V(y_del)-0.5))))
WIRE 1660 240 1660 260
FLAG 1660 240 vbl
WIRE 1660 340 1660 390
FLAG 1660 390 0

* 3. SECOND INTEGRATOR: ACTIVE OTA + C2
TEXT 1900 200 Left 2 ;[3. SECOND INTEGRATOR (OTA + C2)]
SYMBOL bv 1940 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vref_src
SYMATTR Value 0.25
WIRE 1940 240 1940 276
FLAG 1940 240 ref
WIRE 1940 356 1940 390
FLAG 1940 390 0

SYMBOL bi 2140 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Gota
SYMATTR Value I=100u*(V(vbl)-V(ref))
WIRE 2140 240 2140 260
FLAG 2140 240 v2
WIRE 2140 340 2140 390
FLAG 2140 390 0

SYMBOL cap 2300 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName C2
SYMATTR Value 400f
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0
WIRE 2316 240 2316 286
FLAG 2316 240 v2
WIRE 2316 334 2316 390
FLAG 2316 390 0

SYMBOL res 2420 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Rleak2
SYMATTR Value 10MEG
WIRE 2436 240 2436 286
FLAG 2436 240 v2
WIRE 2436 366 2436 390
FLAG 2436 390 0

