* 6. PREDICTIVE SUMMING JUNCTION & QUANTIZER
TEXT 1600 550 Left 2 ;[6. PREDICTIVE LOOK-AHEAD SUMMING JUNCTION & QUANTIZER]
SYMBOL bv 1680 620 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Bpred
SYMATTR Value V=0.7800*(2*V(y_d1)-1.0)+0.2711*(2*V(y_d2)-1.0)
WIRE 1680 600 1680 636
FLAG 1680 600 v_comp
WIRE 1680 716 1680 750
FLAG 1680 750 0

SYMBOL bv 1920 620 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Bvq
SYMATTR Value V=1.864*(V(vbl)-0.25)+1.520*V(v2)-V(v_comp)
WIRE 1920 600 1920 636
FLAG 1920 600 vq
WIRE 1920 716 1920 750
FLAG 1920 750 0

SYMBOL bv 2160 620 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Byout
SYMATTR Value V=(V(vq)>0)
WIRE 2160 600 2160 636
FLAG 2160 600 y_out
WIRE 2160 716 2160 750
FLAG 2160 750 0

